        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "That city Ayodhya is replete with firebrand like skillful warriors that are intolerant of insults, and who have prosecuted their education in archery, chariot-wars, swordplay etc. and with them it is like a cave replete with lions. [1-6-21]"
      }
    ],
